# Y - Ugur interatomic potential, switched, with the angular factor
#
# pair_style ugur/ang
# pair_coeff * * Y_taper.ugur.ang Y
#
# Truncation: switched from 0.85 of each cutoff to the cutoff, quintic, C2 - energy is conserved in MD
